/// <remarks>
/// Generated by <c>tools/gen_sparta_quest_chain.py</c>; do not edit by
/// hand. Every quest an npc hands out is here, split into the two camps
/// the client ships in parallel: the Sparta rows and the Athens rows
/// mirror each other 1000 quest ids apart, so each camp keeps its own
/// order - its tutorials first, then by level - and its own next-quest
/// pointer. A Sparta character is never sent to an Athens npc.
/// <para>
/// A quest whose giver or responder is not an npc the server places is
/// left out: the accept, hand-in and snapshot frames all carry that
/// npc, and an unresolved one is what made the client fault before.
/// </para>
